Rename this file to `server_ca.pem` (same directory) and paste the PEM-encoded
CA certificate that signed your QUIC/MQTT server's certificate. When the real
file is present the build embeds it and turns on QUIC server-certificate
verification automatically (APP_QUIC_VERIFY_PEER=1); without it the client does
NOT authenticate the server and logs a warning on every connection.

-----BEGIN CERTIFICATE-----
... your server's issuing CA certificate here ...
-----END CERTIFICATE-----
